         autoware-model-downloader-1-9-0,
         autoware-maps-1-9-0,
         autoware-ros-packages-1-9-0
Suggests: autoware-data-1-9-0
Description: Autoware complete installation meta-package
 This meta-package installs all Autoware components including
 configuration files, visual theme, sample maps, and runtime packages.
 .
 The ML models are not included. Fetch them as the user who launches
 Autoware with autoware-download-models-1-9-0, which writes them to
 ~/autoware_data, where TensorRT can also cache its engines.
